  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digital Partnerships in Action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The objective of this action is to seek alignment between the EU and its partners (Japan, Republic of Korea, Singapore) in different areas of digital economy with an aim to facilitate digital trade, business links and a human-centric digital transformation by supporting the implementation of Digital Partnerships with Japan, Republic of Korea, and Singapore.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
